PLAIN-LANGUAGE INTENT (controls in case of any ambiguity)
============================================================

The textbooks, curricula, quizzes, question banks, labs, and all other
educational content in this repository are meant to be FREE, forever, for
everyone. This license exists to guarantee three things:

  1. FREE TO USE AND SHARE. Anyone may read, copy, distribute, and adapt this
     material at no cost.

  2. NO ONE MAY PROFIT FROM IT. The material — and anything built from it —
     may NOT be used for commercial advantage or monetary compensation. You
     may not sell it, put it behind a paywall, gate it behind paid
     advertising, bundle it into a paid product or course, or otherwise charge
     for access to it or to derivatives of it.

  3. IT STAYS FREE. Any adaptation or derivative you distribute must be
     released under these same terms, so it can never be captured and made
     unfree by a downstream party. Credit must be given to this project.

If any interpretation of the formal license below would permit charging money
for, or otherwise commercially profiting from, this material or works derived
from it, that interpretation is rejected: the intent above governs.

